# The wide frame (MBUI_WIN=1280x800, 大屏): a picture and a file put in the composer, then each taken off by its ✕ till none.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
picks 截图.png:160x120
key cmd+u
wait 1200
picks 构建日志.log:2000
key cmd+u
wait 1200
tap icon:close
wait 1200
tap icon:close
wait 1500
exit
